[C,changes.txt,9] - added: new `RESTBuilder` aliases `.DELETE()`, `.PUT()`, `.POST()`, `.PATCH() and `.GET()`
[C,changes.txt,10] - added: `schema.before(key, (value, index, index) => value)` is a simple and new alternative to `schema.setPrepare()`
[C,changes.txt,11] - added: `SchemaInstance.$parent` returns a parent schema (if the schema is nested schema)
[C,changes.txt,12] - added: `SchemaOptions.redirect(url)` can perform a redirect from the schema
[C,changes.txt,13] - added: `OperationOptions.redirect(url)` can perform a redirect from the operation
[C,changes.txt,14] - added: `.ics` extension as acceptable file for the web server
[C,changes.txt,15] 
[C,changes.txt,16] - updated: `F.worker2()` returns entire `stdout` buffer in the `callback(err, buffer)`
[C,changes.txt,17] - updated: `$options()` by adding `disabled` key
[C,changes.txt,18] - updated: `String.ROOT()` by adding a support for jComponent `AJAX()` calls
[C,changes.txt,19] - updated: `RESTBuilder.method(method, [data])` added `data` argument
[C,changes.txt,20] - updated: `String.parseDate([format])` added `format` argument
[C,changes.txt,21] - updated: SMTP settings contain `heloid` as `heloidentifier` (manually can be defined `HELO` or `EHLO` command)
[C,changes.txt,22] - updated: SMTP hostname is computed from email if SMTP is not specified
[C,changes.txt,23] 
[A,changes.txt,24] - fixed: critical bug with security + improved security
[C,changes.txt,25] - fixed: system routing
[C,changes.txt,26] - fixed: NoSQL sorting, solved a strange problem
[C,changes.txt,27] - fixed: `U.request()` with `GET` method by @khaledkhalil94 (it doesn't send JSON data if `data` is null/undefined)
[C,changes.txt,28] - fixed: `F.wait()` in WebSocket
[C,changes.txt,29] - fixed: `String.capitalize(true)`
[C,changes.txt,30] - fixed: `REQUEST()` uploading of additional multipart/form-data (removed encoding)
[C,changes.txt,31] - fixed: view engine conditions defined in `<script>`
[C,changes.txt,32] - fixed: auto-redirects in `U.download()`
[C,changes.txt,33] - fixed: image streams resizing
[C,changes.txt,34] - fixed: `@{'%config_key'}` a problem with rendering a value with `'`
[C,changes.txt,35] 
[A,changes.txt,36] - removed: `X-Powered-By`
[A,changes.txt,37] 
[C,changes.txt,38] ======= 3.1.0
[C,changes.txt,39] 
[C,changes.txt,40] - added: CSS variables support default values `border-radius: $radius || 10px`
[C,changes.txt,41] - added: NoSQL storage `.find(beg, end, [threads])` + `.count(beg, end, [threads])` + '.scalar(beg, end, type, field, [threads])' with multiple thread support
[C,changes.txt,42] - added: `U.reader()`
[C,changes.txt,43] - added: `bundles` supports merging files between bundle and project, project file must start with e.g. `--name.js`
[C,changes.txt,44] - added: `.bundlesignore` support with similiar functionality like `.gitignore`
[C,changes.txt,45] - added: support for `SameSite` cookie attribute
[C,changes.txt,46] - added: `RUN()` for executing multiple Total.js operations
[C,changes.txt,47] - added: a new global alias `CONF` (it's a reference to config) for `F.config`
[C,changes.txt,48] - added: a new global alias `FUNC` (it's a reference to functions) for `F.functions`
[C,changes.txt,49] - added: `DatabaseBuilder.arg(key, value)` for adding an dynamic argument
[C,changes.txt,50] - added: NOSQL/TABLE modify supports `!field` as boolean toggle
[C,changes.txt,51] - added: NOSQL/TABLE modify supports a new type `$age: 'js_code'` with some JS code
[C,changes.txt,52] - added: NOSQL/TABLE update supports a new type `'js_code'` with some JS code
